  "prefLabel": "Bfc 105.02 Necessary Quorum",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Bfc 105.02 Necessary Quorum. A quorum shall be required to meet for the purpose of discussion, receiving information, conducting a hearing or taking final board actions. A quorum shall be a minimum of 50% of the sitting board members plus one. In the event of a tie vote, the chair shall cast the deciding vote.\n\nSource. #10553-A, eff 3-25-14",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/bfc100.html"
}
